ACCAD Open Motion Project — Female1 idle-derived VRMA
=====================================================

Source BVH:
  ACCAD / The Ohio State University — Open Motion Project
  https://accad.osu.edu/research/motion-lab/mocap-system-and-data
  Archive: Female1_bvh.zip
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported (CC BY 3.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Converted to VRMA with:
  vrm-c/bvh2vrma (MIT) — scale 0.01
  https://github.com/vrm-c/bvh2vrma

Bundled files (renamed for Mnemos idle playlist):
  idle.vrma   ← Female1_A01_Stand.bvh
  idle_2.vrma ← Female1_A02_Sway.bvh
  idle_3.vrma ← Female1_A02_SwayT2.bvh
  idle_4.vrma ← Female1_D2_Wait.bvh
  idle_5.vrma ← Female1_A04_Look.bvh
  idle_6.vrma ← Female1_A03_Swing.bvh

